# jubeat-chart-viewer
===
 The locally running Jubeat chart confirming player (Jubeat Viewer): Browse the music library, replay charts on the 4x4 panel, and check judgment points using frame-by-frame animation of markers. It's useful for creating chart videos, checking charts, and reviewing rhythms before practicing.
